{"id":"en_the-true-heiress-returning-is-the-grand-priestess-of-fat","title":"The true heiress returning is the grand priestess of fat","titleEn":"The true heiress returning is the grand priestess of fat","description":"Elena, the High Priestess of the Hidden Order, finished her last trial only to discover that pieces of her soul had gone missing. Recovering them meant going to the Sterling and Forrester families, where her birth parents lived. A marriage alliance between the two households was already in the works, giving her the opening she needed to return. What she found instead was a web of plotting on both sides, along with enemies who wanted the Hidden Order's power and the Forrester fortune for themselves. As she struggled against these schemes, she also hunted for the lost fragments of her soul. In the end, she exposed the truth, safeguarded who she was and the person she loved, and brought her fate to its close through self-redemption.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-true-heiress-returning-is-the-grand-priestess-of-fat/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-true-heiress-returning-is-the-grand-priestess-of-fat/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["High Fantasy","Strong Heroine","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7chtl4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-true-heiress-returning-is-the-grand-priestess-of-fat_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7chtl4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-true-heiress-returning-is-the-grand-priestess-of-fat_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7chtl4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable